│             },                                                                                                                                  │
│             "user_memory": {}                                                                                                                   │
│         }                                                                                                                                       │
│     )                                                                                                                                           │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - Run your workflow, e.g. with Research().crew().kickoff(inputs={"topic": data,"user_id":"test"}).                                              │
